        "Description": "Good morning 47, this contract is a special one. We&apos;ve recently recieved information that states a high tiered assassin has been hired to kill an English aristocrat, and wire all of her funds and assets to multiple terrorist organizations. There is a bit of a... wrinkle however. Another high tiered assassin has been hired to do almost the same task, but then take out the other assassin in turn. Why don&apos;t we save them both some time 47.",
